.TH NC 1
.SH NAME
nc \- IPv4 network command
.SH SYNOPSIS
nc [-u] [-w seconds] host service; nc -l [-u] [-w seconds] service
.SH DESCRIPTION
Connect or listen for TCP (default) or UDP (-u). Hosts may be names or numeric addresses; services may be numeric ports or /etc/services names for the selected protocol. Unknown names/services exit 2. -w limits blocking socket waits.
